Life
returned.

* [Time collapsed.] -> time_collapsed
* [Pain dissolved.] -> pain_dissolved
* [Life returned.] -> life_returned

=== healing_beyond ===
Healing
beyond
healing.
Not
just
the
stopping
of
blood.
Not
just
the
cleansing
of
uncleanness.
But
the
restoration
of
dignity.
